BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Streamlining LLM access for teaching\, research and learning via O
 penOnDemand at Tufts - Kyle M. Monahan [Tufts]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T110000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T112500
DTSTAMP:20261020T211451Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-H83SAP@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:We have streamlined LLM access on Tufts University’s HPC Clu
 ster through Open OnDemand (OOD)\, enhancing AI use in research\, teaching
 \, and learning.  We present a standardized toolkit of OOD applications: R
 esearch Chatbot (OpenWebUI + Ollama)\, LLM Notebooks (Jupyter + Ollama) an
 d AI Image Generators (StableDiffusion\, ComfyUI). Participants will gain 
 insights into improving LLM accessibility via the OOD interface\, comparin
 g local and cloud based approaches for compute\, aligning LLM tools with r
 esearch needs\, and lessons learned from deployment. Code\, slides\, and d
 ocumentation will be available via GitHub.
LOCATION:Breakout Room
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/H83SAP/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
